#: 6fd295324103457eb4f346c6a641c4c8 d285d0a2769e4ba7aaa739798d0ca680
msgid ""
"The LongBowF405WING supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such DisplayPor is setup by default "
"using UART5. Simultaneous use of the internal OSD and Displayport is "
"allowed. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"LongBowF405WING 支持使用其内置 OSD，采用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）。外部 OSD 支持（如 "
"DisplayPort）默认通过 UART5 设置。支持同时使用内置 OSD 和 DisplayPort。详见 :ref:`common-msp-"
"osd-overview-4.2`。"

